# MTL for crate.obj.
# OBJ/MTL pre-dates PBR — there are no canonical keys for metallic/roughness.
# Sprint 5c uses the engine's MaterialData defaults (Metallic = 0, Roughness = 0.7,
# AO = 1) which give a typical wood/painted surface look. Tweak via the editor's
# Inspector → Material section, or load a glTF model that carries real PBR values.
#
# Diffuse texture is reused from Assets/Textures/test.png. The PBR pipeline reads
# this as "BaseColor" (sRGB, auto-linearised on sample). The legacy map_Ks line
# from Sprint 5a is intentionally removed — the PBR shader doesn't use it.

newmtl crate
Ka 0.2 0.2 0.2
Kd 1.0 1.0 1.0
Ks 1.0 1.0 1.0
Ns 64.0
d  1.0
map_Kd ../Textures/test.png
